          "angle": 180
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "element-class"
        },
        "markdown": "# Element\n\nA chemical element is modeled as a durable chemical identity, not as a cell in a periodic table.\n\n## Authored fields\n\n- `name`\n- `symbol`\n- `atomicNumber`\n- `standardAtomicWeight`\n- `electronConfiguration`\n- `category`\n\nRequired identity data: `name`, `symbol`, and `atomicNumber`.\n\n`group`, `period`, `block`, table coordinates, and table-specific styling are intentionally excluded. They belong to a periodic-table view or classification layer.\n\nThe detail surface represents every authored field. Summary and icon are smaller semantic projections."
      }
    },
